# N8N Workflow Exports

This directory will contain exported N8N workflow JSON files.

## Files to Create

After implementing the workflow in N8N UI using the specifications in `docs/Orchestration.md`:

1. **partner-discovery.json** - Export the main workflow from N8N
   - Contains all 21 nodes as specified in Section 3.3
   - Includes node connections as specified in Section 3.4

## How to Export

1. Open the workflow in N8N
2. Click the three-dot menu (...)
3. Select "Download"
4. Save as `partner-discovery.json` in this directory

## Implementation Reference

See `docs/Orchestration.md` Section 3 for:
- Complete node specifications (21 nodes)
- Node configuration JSON examples
- Connection mapping
- Environment variable setup




